        "identifier": "https://github.com/math-inc/Sphere-Packing-Lean",
        "note": "Formalizes, among much else, the Delsarte bound of 196560 for the kissing number in dimension 24 and the uniqueness of the Leech configuration. There the plain LP bound is sharp; in dimension 3 it is not, which is why Musin's extension is needed here. No code is shared.",
